Dafny Kotlin Runtime

Runtime support for Dafny programs compiled to Kotlin. This is a Kotlin
Multiplatform (KMP) Gradle module, not a single file:

  src/commonMain/kotlin/dafny/   core runtime (sequences, sets, maps, multisets,
                                 tuples, function types, BigRational, code points,
                                 type descriptors) shared by all platforms
  src/jvmMain/                   JVM actuals (dafny.BigInteger over java.math)
  src/jsMain/, nativeMain/,      non-JVM actuals (exit; BigInteger via the
  nonJvmMain/                    ionspin multiplatform-bignum library)

The `kt`/`kmp` backends embed this source into the generated project.

To build the JVM runtime jar:

  $ gradle jvmJar

To run on the multiplatform targets (from an assembled `dafny build -t kmp`
project):

  $ gradle jsNodeRun                        # JS / Node
  $ gradle runReleaseExecutableMacosArm64   # Native (host-dependent task name)
